	(text "Supply filter: 0 ohm fitted by default. If range or packet loss points to supply\nnoise, fit a ferrite bead instead (e.g. 600 ohm at 100 MHz, low DCR, 0603), and\ncheck for bead/ceramic resonance. Caps at the socket's VCC/GND pins: 100 nF closest.\nBulk (DNP): fit 47-100 uF only for a PA/LNA module (>100 mA in TX)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 45.72 0)
